---
source: tests/diff.rs
expression: s
---
--- unknown: diff nosuch
exit 2
ricepilot: profile `nosuch`: no such profile. expected a directory at <HOME>/.local/share/ricepilot/profiles/nosuch

--- not_a_name: diff ../new
exit 2
ricepilot: profile `../new`: profile name must be a single directory name

--- unparsable_manifest: diff new
exit 2
ricepilot: profile `new`: <HOME>/.local/share/ricepilot/profiles/new/profile.toml does not parse: unclosed array, expected `]`

--- another_profile_unparsable: diff new
exit 2
ricepilot: profile `old`: <HOME>/.local/share/ricepilot/profiles/old/profile.toml does not parse: unclosed array, expected `]`

--- ledger: diff new
exit 2
ricepilot: refusing: the ledger does not parse, so ricepilot cannot tell which live paths it owns: invalid type: integer `3`, expected path string (<HOME>/.local/state/ricepilot/ledger.toml) [R4]

--- config_is_a_link: diff new
exit 2
ricepilot: refusing: intermediate path component is a symlink; refusing to traverse it (<HOME>/.config) [R3]

--- file_copy: diff new
exit 3
ricepilot: not possible: `~/.config/hypr` declares kind = file-copy; v1 activates dir-link only (v1.1) [see docs/NOT-POSSIBLE.md#file-activation]
